          },
          "worked": "The domain is $x>0$. Express $\\log_3(x)$ using natural logarithms:\n$$\\begin{align*}\\ln(x)-\\frac{\\ln(x)}{\\ln(3)}&=1\\\\\\left(1-\\frac{1}{\\ln(3)}\\right)\\ln(x)&=1\\\\\\ln(x)&=\\frac{\\ln(3)}{\\ln(3)-1}\\\\x&=e^{\\frac{\\ln(3)}{\\ln(3)-1}}\\\\x&\\approx 68{,}921.54.\\end{align*}$$\nThe answer is correct to two decimal places.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 64
